From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 06:42:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Preflight enrolled destinations before freezing
 origin forwards

Read fresh authenticated /v2/machines only after origin and lease authorization; never use synced discovery as authority. Durable retries skip the lookup. Unknown destinations reject, malformed/unavailable inventory remains pending. Proof: focused suites, real courier three-hop fixture, and 12 exact-anchor killing mutations.
